Finite-strain consistent tangent (stage 2 of the NLGEOM port).

Under NLGEOM the U3 element now returns the exact derivative of the
u3nlforce internal force, u3nltan.f, instead of the small-strain operator:

    du -> dF -> dF~ -> (dJ~, dJbar) -> dFbar -> dT -> dA -> df

with the ring weights (E row) at both ends, the cyclic chain (S row)
inside dJbar, the Hencky tangent taken in the eigenbasis of
B = Fbar Fbar^T, and both terms of the current-volume factor J~ V_h.  Rows
are the ring and columns the support -- exactly the ring x support
structure the deck already encodes -- so mastruct, the structure and the
generator are untouched.

U2 IS ALSO SKIPPED under NLGEOM.  The finite-strain force already carries
the deviatoric half, so adding U2's small-strain deviatoric stiffness to
its tangent would double-count it; the Newton matrix is the U3 tangent
alone.

VERIFIED.  u3nltan matches FbarNL.tangent (the prototype chain, itself
verified against central differences) to 6e-15 at a finite displacement
field and the small-strain operator to 5e-15 at u = 0
(elements_ccx/tests/verify_nltan.py, which compiles a per-edge driver and
assembles the global matrix).  Through CalculiX, a NLGEOM
boundary-value problem now shows quadratic corrections per increment
(1.3e-2 -> 9.5e-4 -> 1.9e-6 -> 2.2e-11 in the first one) and the reactions
match FbarNL.force(u_ccx) to 1.4e-7 at eps = 1e-3 and 3.9e-7 at eps = 1e-2
(elements_ccx/tests/verify_nlccx.py).

KNOWN LIMIT.  ccx's full Newton step can still drive a trial state into an
inverted element at larger strain; the element then returns a null block
for that trial (rather than aborting, matching e_c3d's nonpositive-jacobian
handling) and ccx cuts the increment back.  With the default step control
the analysis reaches roughly 1-2 % strain on the MMS cell before the
trial states start inverting; smaller *STATIC increments extend that.
A Newton line search or arc-length control on the ccx side is the proper
remedy and is not part of this patch.

  Makefile.inc       builds u3nltan.f
  e_c3d_u.f          passes iperturb/vold to the U3 dispatcher
  mafillsmas.f       the same for the asymmetric assembly
  mafillsm.f         skips U2 under NLGEOM

The element sources themselves (u3nltan.f, e_c3d_u3.f) live in
../elements_ccx/ and are copied into src/ before building.

